       "id": "22081607"
      }
     ],
     "value": "ZDHHC5-catalyzed palmitoylation predominantly occurs at Cys-4. ZDHHC5-catalyzed palmitoylation may be required for the formation of higher-order complexes and for neurite outgrowth in cultured neural stem cells"
    }
